custom_components/daylight/color_and_brightness.py is a modified port of
adaptive-lighting's custom_components/adaptive_lighting/color_and_brightness.py.
Changes: the sun-timing calculations (SunEvents) are carried over unchanged;
the brightness/color curve functions were rewritten to emit normalized
[0, 1] factors instead of values baked against a config entry's min/max
brightness and color temperature, and sleep-mode and legacy RGB-only-color
branches were removed as out of scope for this project.
